<view style="font-size: 120%; font-weight: bolder; position: relative; left: 136rpx; top: 30rpx; width: 511rpx; height: 54rpx; display: block; box-sizing: border-box">1. 每个人只有一次机会填写</view>
<view style="font-size: 120%; font-weight: bolder; width: 511rpx; height: 54rpx; display: block; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; left: 136rpx; top: 57rpx">2. 填写信息点击保存</view>
<view style="font-size: 120%; font-weight: bolder; width: 538rpx; height: 104rpx; display: block; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; left: 142rpx; top: 82rpx">3. 下次进入将不再出现本页面</view>

